处，Flos Arco弧形落地灯优雅地悬垂着，抛物线般的不锈钢臂延伸出近两米的跨度，大理石底座沉稳如锚，半球形乳白灯罩将光线柔化后轻轻洒向沙发区——即便未点亮，它本身已是雕塑般的存在。\n整个空间摒弃冗余装饰，仅以几件经得起时间考验的设计单品对话：低矮的模块茶几、一本摊开的建筑期刊、窗边一株姿态舒展的琴叶榕。Nikon Z6 II搭配35mm f/1.8镜头所捕捉的，不仅是场景，更是一种生活哲学——理性、宁静、以人为本。\nf/1.8的浅景深虚化了背景书架的细节，却让620椅的木质纹理与Arco灯杆的金属冷感形成微妙质感对比。晨光在此不是主角，而是最温柔的策展人，照亮了“少，却更好”（Less, but better）的日常实践。\n这帧画面，是包豪斯精神与北欧温润感在当代住宅中的诗意交汇。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 51, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 43, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [291.0296325683594, 508.8639831542969], "pos": [1284.6011962890625, 492.43414306640625], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 58, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 49, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [57], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 262], "pos": [567.5564575195312, 469.10589599609375], "widgets_values": [198483125005889, "randomize", 8, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 53, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 54, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 55, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 56, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Laten